    <a class="gs-buy gs-buy-sm gs-hide-sm" href="/cart/55175892599131:1?ref=landing"><span data-i="k187">Prezzo Founder</span><svg class="gs-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
  </div>
</nav></header>
<main class="gs-rp" data-studio>
  <div class="gs-wrap gs-st-wrap">
    <p class="gs-kicker"><span data-i="k188">Prova gratuita · una per persona</span></p>
    <h1 class="gs-h2"><span data-i="k189">Progetta il tuo spazio</span></h1>
    <p class="gs-lead"><span data-i="k190">Più dettagli ci dai, più il progetto ti somiglia. Solo foto e città sono obbligatorie, il resto puoi saltarlo.</span></p>
    <div class="gs-ai-used" data-used hidden>
      <p class="gs-h3"><span data-i="k191">Hai già fatto la tua prova gratuita</span></p><p class="gs-muted"><span data-i="k192">La prova è una per persona. Il tuo progetto ti aspetta qui:</span></p>
      <a class="gs-buy gs-buy-full" href="/pages/il-tuo-progetto"><span data-i="k193">Vedi il tuo progetto</span><svg class="gs-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
      <p class="gs-small"><span data-i="k194">Con il Pass Founder avrai progetti illimitati dal lancio.</span></p>
    </div>
    <form class="gs-st" novalidate data-st-form>
      <ol class="gs-st-steps" aria-hidden="true"><li data-sn="0" class=is-on><span>1</span><span data-i="k178">La foto</span></li><li data-sn="1"><span>2</span><span data-i="k179">Il posto</span></li><li data-sn="2"><span>3</span><span data-i="k180">Lo stile</span></li><li data-sn="3"><span>4</span><span data-i="k181">Come lo usi</span></li><li data-sn="4"><span>5</span><span data-i="k182">Invio</span></li></ol>
      <div class="gs-st-bar"><i data-st-bar></i></div>

      <fieldset class="gs-st-step" data-step="0">
        <legend class="gs-h3"><span data-i="k195">1 · Carica la foto</span></legend>
        <label class="gs-drop" data-drop>
          <input type="file" accept="image/*" data-file class="gs-sr">
          <span class="gs-drop-empty"><svg class="gs-ic gs-drop-ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4V2M12 22v-2M4 12H2M22 12h-2M5.6 5.6 4.2 4.2M19.8 19.8l-1.4-1.4M5.6 18.4l-1.4 1.4M19.8 4.2l-1.4 1.4M12 8a4 4 0 1 0 0 8 4 4 0 0 0 0-8z"/></svg><b><span data-i="k196">Carica una foto del tuo spazio</span></b><small><span data-i="k197">Tocca per scattarla o sceglierla. Meglio di giorno, inquadrando tutto lo spazio.</span></small></span>
          <span class="gs-drop-prev" hidden><img alt="" data-prev><em><span data-i="k198">Cambia foto</span></em></span>
        </label>
        <p class="gs-label"><span data-i="k199">Che spazio è?</span></p>
        <div class="gs-seg" data-seg><button type="button" class="gs-segb is-on" data-sp="garden"><span data-i="k39">Giardino</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-segb" data-sp="terrace"><span data-i="k40">Terrazzo</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-segb" data-sp="balcony"><span data-i="k41">Balcone</span></button></div>
        <label class="gs-label" for="gs-st-size"><span data-i="k200">Quanto è grande? (m², anche a occhio)</span></label>
        <div class="gs-st-size"><input id="gs-st-size" type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="1" max="5000" class="gs-input" data-ip="k183" placeholder="Es. 20"><span>m²</span></div>
        <div class="gs-chips"><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-size="5">5 m²</button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-size="15">15 m²</button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-size="40">40 m²</button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-size="100">100 m²</button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-size="300">300 m²</button></div>
        <div class="gs-st-nav"><span></span><button type="button" class="gs-buy" data-next><span data-i="k201">Avanti</span><svg class="gs-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button></div>
      </fieldset>

      <fieldset class="gs-st-step" data-step="1" hidden>
        <legend class="gs-h3"><span data-i="k202">2 · Dove si trova</span></legend>
        <label class="gs-label" for="gs-ai-loc"><span data-i="k203">Dove si trova?</span></label>
        <input id="gs-ai-loc" type="text" autocomplete="address-level2" class="gs-input" maxlength="80" data-ip="k42" placeholder="Città o CAP, es. Verona o 37121">
        <p class="gs-small gs-hint"><span data-i="k204">Serve per scegliere piante che reggono il tuo inverno e per i prezzi della tua zona.</span></p>
        <p class="gs-label"><span data-i="k205">Quanto sole prende?</span></p>
        <div class="gs-seg gs-seg4" data-exp><button type="button" class="gs-segb is-on" data-ex=""><span data-i="k43">Non so</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-segb" data-ex="sun"><span data-i="k44">Pieno sole</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-segb" data-ex="part"><span data-i="k45">Mezz&#x27;ombra</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-segb" data-ex="shade"><span data-i="k46">Ombra</span></button></div>
        <p class="gs-label"><span data-i="k206">Come puoi annaffiare?</span></p>
        <div class="gs-chips"><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-water="none" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k207">Non posso annaffiare</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-water="manual" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k208">A mano</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-water="automatic" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k209">Impianto automatico</span></button></div>
        <div class="gs-st-nav"><button type="button" class="gs-ghost gs-ghost-sm" data-back>← <span data-i="k210">Indietro</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-buy" data-next><span data-i="k211">Avanti</span><svg class="gs-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button></div>
      </fieldset>

      <fieldset class="gs-st-step" data-step="2" hidden>
        <legend class="gs-h3"><span data-i="k212">3 · Stile, colori e budget</span></legend>
        <p class="gs-label"><span data-i="k213">Che stile ti piace?</span></p>
        <div class="gs-opts"><button type="button" class="gs-opt" data-style="modern" aria-pressed="false"><b><span data-i="k149">Moderno</span></b><small><span data-i="k150">Linee pulite, materiali contemporanei</span></small></button><button type="button" class="gs-opt" data-style="mediterranean" aria-pressed="false"><b><span data-i="k151">Mediterraneo</span></b><small><span data-i="k152">Ulivi, lavanda, terracotta</span></small></button><button type="button" class="gs-opt" data-style="natural" aria-pressed="false"><b><span data-i="k153">Naturale</span></b><small><span data-i="k154">Prato fiorito, aspetto spontaneo</span></small></button><button type="button" class="gs-opt" data-style="japanese" aria-pressed="false"><b><span data-i="k155">Giapponese</span></b><small><span data-i="k156">Aceri, ghiaia, muschio</span></small></button><button type="button" class="gs-opt" data-style="cottage" aria-pressed="false"><b><span data-i="k157">Inglese</span></b><small><span data-i="k158">Bordure fiorite e rose</span></small></button><button type="button" class="gs-opt" data-style="tropical" aria-pressed="false"><b><span data-i="k159">Tropicale</span></b><small><span data-i="k160">Foglie grandi, verde intenso</span></small></button><button type="button" class="gs-opt" data-style="minimal" aria-pressed="false"><b><span data-i="k161">Minimal</span></b><small><span data-i="k162">Poche specie, molto ordine</span></small></button><button type="button" class="gs-opt" data-style="formal" aria-pressed="false"><b><span data-i="k163">Classico</span></b><small><span data-i="k164">Siepi potate, simmetria</span></small></button></div>
        <p class="gs-label"><span data-i="k214">Colori dei fiori (fino a 4)</span></p>
        <div class="gs-chips"><button type="button" class="gs-chipb gs-color" data-color="white" aria-pressed="false"><i style="background:#F2F1EA"></i><span data-i="k171">Bianco</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb gs-color" data-color="green" aria-pressed="false"><i style="background:#3C8A52"></i><span data-i="k172">Solo verde</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb gs-color" data-color="blue_purple" aria-pressed="false"><i style="background:#7466D9"></i><span data-i="k173">Blu e viola</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb gs-color" data-color="pink" aria-pressed="false"><i style="background:#E98BB5"></i><span data-i="k174">Rosa</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb gs-color" data-color="red_orange" aria-pressed="false"><i style="background:#E0613A"></i><span data-i="k175">Rosso e arancio</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb gs-color" data-color="yellow" aria-pressed="false"><i style="background:#F0C541"></i><span data-i="k176">Giallo</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb gs-color" data-color="silver" aria-pressed="false"><i style="background:#B8C0BD"></i><span data-i="k177">Argento</span></button></div>
        <p class="gs-label"><span data-i="k215">Quanto tempo vuoi dedicarci?</span></p>
        <div class="gs-opts gs-opts3"><button type="button" class="gs-opt" data-maint="low" aria-pressed="false"><b><span data-i="k165">Poca</span></b><small><span data-i="k166">1 ora al mese</span></small></button><button type="button" class="gs-opt" data-maint="medium" aria-pressed="false"><b><span data-i="k167">Media</span></b><small><span data-i="k168">1 ora a settimana</span></small></button><button type="button" class="gs-opt" data-maint="high" aria-pressed="false"><b><span data-i="k169">Tanta</span></b><small><span data-i="k170">Mi piace curarlo</span></small></button></div>
        <p class="gs-label"><span data-i="k216">Budget indicativo</span></p>
        <div class="gs-chips"><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-budget="lt500" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k217">Fino a 500 €</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-budget="500_1500" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k218">500–1.500 €</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-budget="1500_5000" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k219">1.500–5.000 €</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-budget="5000_15000" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k220">5.000–15.000 €</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-budget="gt15000" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k221">Oltre 15.000 €</span></button></div>
        <div class="gs-st-nav"><button type="button" class="gs-ghost gs-ghost-sm" data-back>← <span data-i="k222">Indietro</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-buy" data-next><span data-i="k223">Avanti</span><svg class="gs-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button></div>
      </fieldset>

      <fieldset class="gs-st-step" data-step="3" hidden>
        <legend class="gs-h3"><span data-i="k224">4 · Come lo vivi</span></legend>
        <p class="gs-label"><span data-i="k225">Per cosa lo usi?</span></p>
        <div class="gs-chips"><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-use="relax" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k226">Relax</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-use="dining" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k227">Pranzi all&#x27;aperto</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-use="kids" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k228">Bambini</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-use="pets" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k229">Cani o gatti</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-use="vegetables" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k230">Orto</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-use="entertaining" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k231">Feste e amici</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-use="privacy" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k232">Privacy</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-use="wildlife" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k233">Api e farfalle</span></button></div>
        <p class="gs-label"><span data-i="k234">Cosa vorresti avere?</span></p>
        <div class="gs-chips"><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-feat="lawn" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k235">Prato</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-feat="paving" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k236">Pavimentazione</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-feat="raised_beds" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k237">Aiuole rialzate</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-feat="pergola" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k238">Pergola</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-feat="water_feature" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k239">Fontana</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-feat="lighting" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k240">Luci</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-feat="irrigation" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k241">Irrigazione</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-feat="seating" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k242">Zona seduta</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-feat="fire_pit" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k243">Braciere</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-feat="pots" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k244">Vasi grandi</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-feat="climbers" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k245">Rampicanti</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-chipb" data-feat="hedge" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i="k246">Siepe</span></button></div>
        <label class="gs-label" for="gs-st-keep"><span data-i="k247">Cosa deve restare com&#x27;è</span></label>
        <input id="gs-st-keep" type="text" class="gs-input" maxlength="200" data-ip="k184" placeholder="Es. il vecchio ulivo, la pavimentazione esistente">
        <label class="gs-label" for="gs-st-avoid"><span data-i="k248">Cosa vuoi evitare</span></label>
        <input id="gs-st-avoid" type="text" class="gs-input" maxlength="200" data-ip="k185" placeholder="Es. rose con spine, piante che sporcano">
        <label class="gs-label" for="gs-ai-desc"><span data-i="k249">Altro da dirci? (facoltativo)</span></label>
        <textarea id="gs-ai-desc" rows="3" maxlength="300" data-ip="k38" placeholder="Es. un angolo pranzo all&#x27;ombra, poca manutenzione, piante profumate"></textarea>
        <div class="gs-st-nav"><button type="button" class="gs-ghost gs-ghost-sm" data-back>← <span data-i="k250">Indietro</span></button><button type="button" class="gs-buy" data-next><span data-i="k251">Avanti</span><svg class="gs-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button></div>
      </fieldset>

      <fieldset class="gs-st-step" data-step="4" hidden>
        <legend class="gs-h3"><span data-i="k252">5 · Ricevi il progetto</span></legend>
        <div class="gs-st-sum" data-st-sum></div>
        <input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" class="gs-hp" data-hp aria-hidden="true">
        <label class="gs-label" for="gs-ai-email"><span data-i="k253">La tua email</span></label>
        <input id="gs-ai-email" type="email" autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" class="gs-input" data-ip="k17" placeholder="tu@esempio.it">
        <label class="gs-consent"><input type="checkbox" data-consent> <span><span data-i="k254">Voglio ricevere email sul lancio. Ho letto l&#x27;</span><a href="/policies/privacy-policy" target="_blank"><span data-i="k255">informativa privacy</span></a>.</span></label>
        <div class="gs-st-nav"><button type="button" class="gs-ghost gs-ghost-sm" data-back>← <span data-i="k256">Indietro</span></button><button type="submit" class="gs-buy" data-go><span data-i="k257">Genera il mio progetto · gratis</span><svg class="gs-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button></div>
        <p class="gs-small"><span data-i="k258">Una prova gratuita per persona. La foto serve solo a creare il render e non viene salvata.</span></p>
      </fieldset>
      <p class="gs-err" role="alert" data-err hidden></p>
    </form>
  </div>
</main>
